cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the companion paper."
title: "PersCase"
abstract: >
  PersCase is a web tool with which instructors draft professional case
  studies in four stages: input, retrieval, generation, and editing by the
  instructor. It retrieves notes written for each discipline, generates
  a structured draft, and produces one variant per student team. Finance,
  marketing and social work are included.
